      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0002>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "보시다시피 저는 예술가예요.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BCF4C2DCB2E4C2DCD53C0020C800B2940020C608C220AC00C608C694002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "다음 콩쿠르에 제출할\n풍경화를 그리는 중이었는데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E4C74C0020CF69CFE0B974C5D00020C81CCD9CD560000AD48DACBDD654B97C0020ADF8B9ACB2940020C911C774C5C8B294B370002E002E002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저쪽을 봐 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800CABDC7440020BD100020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "분수 앞을\n덩굴이 가로막고 있지 뭐예요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD84C2180020C55EC744000AB369AD74C7740020AC00B85CB9C9ACE00020C788C9C00020BB50C608C6940021001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "제 포켓몬의 기술로는\n부술 수가 없었어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C81C0020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220B85CB294000ABD80C2200020C218AC000020C5C6C5C8C5B4C694002E002E002E001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앗! 영감이 떠올랐어요!\n부술 수 없다면 태워 버리면 되지 않을까요?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C55700210020C601AC10C7740020B5A0C62CB790C5B4C6940021000ABD80C2200020C2180020C5C6B2E4BA740020D0DCC6CC0020BC84B9ACBA740020B418C9C00020C54AC744AE4CC694003F001000020114017B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "부탁드려요!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n저의 고민을 해결하기 위해\n저 방해되는 덩굴을<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n포켓몬의 기술로 태워 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŻ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD80D0C1B4DCB824C694002100100001BE01000AC800C7580020ACE0BBFCC7440020D574ACB0D558AE300020C704D574000AC8000020BC29D574B418B2940020B369AD74C74400100001BE00000AD3ECCF13BAACC7580020AE30C220B85C0020D0DCC6CC0020C8FCC138C6940021001000020114017B0000",
